                            jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-02T11:20:18.616-05:00"
                            jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                            jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                            sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/container/v2/container">
                            <text
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-12-02T05:05:38.150-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:09:02.754-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>AbbVie medicines are used to treat serious illnesses that can affect people of all ages at different stages of life. This is where we come in to make a real difference for these people and their families. But we are not yet satisfied with that.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Our support for patients goes beyond medicines: We maintain various partnerships in order to better understand patients' needs, raise awareness and facilitate access to healthcare.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Tackling the most complex challenges in healthcare requires a dynamic and collaborative way of working. As a forward-looking company, we seek dialogue and cooperation with all key representatives of the healthcare system.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <separator_648415771
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2024-03-02T11:22:01.188-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-03-02T11:22:01.188-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <title
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-12-02T05:07:44.636-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:09:17.853-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="Promises turned into reality"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"
                                variant="h"/>
                            <text_20888409
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-12-02T05:07:49.822-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-07-31T04:13:38.766-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="kaspatx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>AbbVie is a young company, but we have already proven that we keep our promises. Over 60 million people in more than 175 countries are now benefiting from our medicinal products. We specialise in the fields of immunology, oncology, virology, neurology, ophthalmology and aesthetic medicine.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>In recent years, AbbVie has invested heavily in scientific research and has been able to translate this into a strong &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.abbvie.com/science/pipeline.html&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;>pipeline&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with promising therapeutic options. These complement our portfolio of proven medicinal products.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                            <separator
                                cq:styleIds="[1662756456518]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-12-02T05:12:51.647-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2023-12-02T05:12:51.647-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/separator/v2/separator"/>
                            <title_811560958
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678,1661545829678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-12-02T05:10:50.311-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2024-05-09T22:10:52.947-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                jcr:title="Our employees are our potential "
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/title/v2/title"
                                type="h3"
                                variant="h"/>
                            <text_1644337255
                                cq:styleIds="[1659545825678]"
                                jcr:created="{Date}2023-12-02T05:11:59.884-05:00"
                                jcr:createdBy="jewitca"
                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-29T11:43:55.484-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="HIRSCLX"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                langAttribute="none"
                                text="&lt;p>Satisfied employees are the driving force behind our success. Our culture supports the continuous learning and development of our employees. We offer flexible working models – from flexitime to working from home &lt;a href=&quot;/content/abbvie-com2/ch/en/join-us/life-at-abbvie/benefits.html&quot;>benefits&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp; We are mothers, fathers, daughters and sons and promote the compatibility of family and career.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>In recognition of this, we have repeatedly received the &lt;a href=&quot;/content/abbvie-com2/ch/en/who-we-are/our-stories/abbvie-is-a-great-place-to-work-2026.html&quot;>Certificate as a Great Place to Work&amp;nbsp;In 2026&lt;/a>, AbbVie Switzerland was given the award Great Place to Work Switzerland for the twelfth time as one of the best employers in the Large-sized company category.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>The approximately 280 employees at AbbVie Switzerland are committed to ensuring that innovative and high-quality medicines are available to patients. In doing so, we are making an important contribution and creating great benefits for society. Over 55,000 people around the world work for AbbVie.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </container>
