                                        sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                        text="&lt;p>AbbVie Switzerland has been headquartered in the Canton of Zug for more than 58 years (before 2013 as Abbott). Today, our home is in Cham. AbbVie has subsidiaries in over 70 countries worldwide.&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
